Source: limpet-mcp-meta
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Lumen Industries <packaging@lumen.local>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2

Package: limpet-mcp-meta
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11)
Description: Limpet unified MCP meta-server
 Manifest-driven multiplexer that exposes multiple child MCP servers (stdio
 subprocesses) as one JSON-RPC endpoint, restarting children on a changed
 command/env and bounding reads so a hung child cannot wedge the server.
 Ships with every manifest entry disabled (see /etc/limpet/mcp-meta/manifest.json)
 until an operator enables a specific child server.
